[24:15.91]It radiates outward. 
[24:17.68]It shines like the sun among the many moons in the world.
[24:22.11]Being from the brightness of abundance doesn't allow the darkness to appear or be in the path unless a choice to allow it to. 
[24:31.20]The true state of abundance doesn't have room for lies or games normally played. 
[24:36.59]The space is too full of abundance. 
[24:39.21]This may be a challenge because we still need to shine for others to see.
[24:44.75]Abundance is seeing people for their gifts and not what they lack or could be. 
[24:51.33]Seeing all things for their gifts and not what they lack.
[24:55.81]Start by knowing what your abundance is, fill that space with you, and be fully present from that state of being. 
[25:04.46]Your profession of choice is telling you this already. 
[25:08.06]Coaches have an abundance of knowing the possibilities. 
[25:11.82]That is their gift. 
[25:13.63]Consultants and customer service professionals have the abundance of success, practicality, in common. 
[25:20.74]Administrative assistants and virtual assistants have an abundance of coordination and time management. 
[25:27.45]Abundance is all around you, and all within. 
[25:31.37]See what it is; love yourself for what it is, not what you're missing, or what that can be better, but for what it is at this present moment.
[25:42.79]Be in a state of abundance of what you already have. 
[25:46.78]I guarantee they are there; it always is buried but there. 
